### Step 3 – Conditional formatting

- Added data bars to Total Sales in a table/matrix to highlight high/low values.
- Created variance measures (Sales Var, Sales Var %) to compare this year vs last year.
- Applied rule-based formatting:
  - Green for positive variance, red for negative.
- Added icons (up/down) for quick interpretation.
- Used Data colors (fx) on a chart to color bars based on rules.

