### Step 4 – Sort by other columns

- Sorted `dim_date[MonthName]` by `dim_date[MonthNumber]` to ensure months display in correct order.
- (Optional) Created `YearMonth` and `YearMonthSort` to support correct sorting across multiple years.
- Sorted charts using visual sort options (e.g., Total Sales descending).
- Sorted tables by Total Sales to show top customers first.

